- Chiikawa characters: chiikawa, hachiware, usagi
- Content rating marks: MPA, ESRB, PEGI, BBFC, ACB, Eirin, CERO, KMRB, USK,
  CADPA (the rating-* icons, except the original rating-sensitivity-* set)
- Creative Commons symbols (cc and the cc-* icons)
- Company and project logos: GitHub (github), Model Context Protocol (mcp)
  and programming language logos
